/ HERNAN DAVID SANCHEZ ALARCON
		    
	    Input
	    Store cases      /Casos

Wbody1, Load i   	    /Bucle principal
       Subt cases		
       Skipcond 000     /i<casoss??
       Jump endwbody1   /no
       			        /si, haga todo lo de abajo
       Input
       Store a          /input a
       Input
       Store b          /input b
       Load cero
       Store suma       /inicializa suma en 0
       
       Load a           /dejar current = a
       Store current
       
SumLoop, Load suma
        Add current     /suma = suma+current
        Store suma
        
        Load current
        Add one         /current = current+1
        Store current
        
        Load current
        Subt one
        Subt b          /Current compara con b
        Skipcond 400    /Si ha llego a b, ha terminado!
        Jump SumLoop    /Si no continua en bucle
       
        Load suma		
        Output          /Output suma
        
        Load i
        Add one
        Store i         /i =i +1
        
        Jump Wbody1     /Siguiente caso
 
endwbody1, Halt
 
cases,   DEC 0
cero,    DEC 0
i,       DEC 0
suma,    DEC 0
a,       DEC 0
b,       DEC 0
current, DEC 0
one,     DEC 1